{"version":1,"width":1080,"height":1920,"html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"nl\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"loveke-size\" content=\"1080x1920\">\n<title>Story gemaakt op bestelling</title>\n<style>/* Loveke Instagram-huisstijl. Lettertypes lokaal (fontsource), geen netwerk nodig. */\n@font-face{font-family:'Lilita One';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/lilita-one-latin-400-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:400}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-400-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:400}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-600-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:600}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-700-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:700}\n@font-face{font-family:'Caveat';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/caveat-latin-600-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:600}\n@font-face{font-family:'Caveat';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/caveat-latin-700-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:700}\n:root{--cream:#FFF8F0;--black:#1A1A1A;--orange:#FF7033;--yellow:#FFD43D;--red:#E3404B;--pink:#FF85A1}\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0}\n.wm{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#E3404B 0%,#FF7033 55%,#FFC93D 100%);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}\n.dots{background-image:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(26,26,26,.10) 2.5px,transparent 2.5px);background-size:22px 22px}\n/* Plek voor een Instagram-sticker (poll, link, vraag, aftelling): leeg in de export. */\n.slot{visibility:hidden}\n</style>\n\n</head>\n<body>\n<div style=\"width: 1080px; height: 1920px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FFF8F0; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: 260px 90px 360px; gap: 44px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; color: #1A1A1A\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Caveat', cursive; font-weight: 700; font-size: 72px; line-height: 1; color: #E3404B\" data-slot=\"bovenregel\" data-label=\"Bovenregel\" data-max=\"26\">eerlijk is eerlijk</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 112px; line-height: 0.95\" data-slot=\"titel\" data-label=\"Titel\" data-max=\"29\">Gemaakt op bestelling</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.4\">Geen stapels kleren die niemand koopt. Elk stuk wordt pas gedrukt als jij het bestelt.</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 5px solid #1A1A1A; border-radius: 28px; padding: 26px 32px; box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #1A1A1A\">\n<div style=\"flex: 0 0 auto; width: 100px; height: 100px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FF7033; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 56px\">1</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 40px; font-weight: 700\" data-slot=\"stap1\" data-label=\"Stap 1\" data-max=\"34\">Jij bestelt op loveke.be</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 5px solid #1A1A1A; border-radius: 28px; padding: 26px 32px; box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #1A1A1A\">\n<div style=\"flex: 0 0 auto; width: 100px; height: 100px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FFD43D; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 56px\">2</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 40px; font-weight: 700\" data-slot=\"stap2\" data-label=\"Stap 2\" data-max=\"36\">Het wordt voor jou gedrukt</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 5px solid #1A1A1A; border-radius: 28px; padding: 26px 32px; box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #1A1A1A\">\n<div style=\"flex: 0 0 auto; width: 100px; height: 100px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FF85A1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 56px\">3</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 40px; font-weight: 700\" data-slot=\"stap3\" data-label=\"Stap 3\" data-max=\"28\">Gratis bij jou thuis</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.4; color: #3D3D3D\" data-slot=\"onderregel\" data-label=\"Onderregel\" data-max=\"78\">Reken op 5 tot 20 werkdagen. Het wachten waard, beloofd.</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}